# Diab Gebäudereinigung — Project Requirements

## Project overview

A modern, responsive website for Diab Gebäudereinigung.

The website presents the company, its cleaning services, contact details, and legal information.

## Target audience

- Hotels
- Offices
- Medical practices
- Property owners
- Private households
- Commercial customers

## Primary language

German

## Main goals

- Present the company professionally
- Explain the available cleaning services
- Make contacting the company easy
- Improve local visibility in search engines
- Provide legally required pages for Germany

## Initial pages

- Home
- Leistungen
- Über uns
- Kontakt
- Impressum
- Datenschutz

## Initial services

### Hotelreinigung

- Zimmerreinigung
- Badezimmer- und Sanitärreinigung
- Bettwäschewechsel
- Reinigung öffentlicher Bereiche
- Wellness- und Spa-Bereiche
- Konferenzräume und Restaurants

### Gebäudereinigung

- Büroreinigung
- Praxisreinigung
- Treppenhausreinigung
- Unterhaltsreinigung
- Glas- und Fensterreinigung
- Baureinigung
- Sonderreinigungen

## Technical scope

- Next.js
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Responsive design
- Local fonts
- SEO metadata
- Contact form
- Google Maps integration with privacy protection
- No login
- No database in the first version
- No admin dashboard

## Missing business information

- Official company address
- Legal business form
- Tax identification information
- Exact service area
- Business hours
- WhatsApp number
- Google Business Profile URL
- Final legal texts